flowchart LR
  T[Trigger<br/>session saved · day change · question asked] --> R{AI available<br/>and consented?}
  R -- no --> RU[Rules path<br/>analysis → candidates → policy]
  R -- yes --> AIQ[AI asked with redacted snapshot]
  AIQ --> P{Reply parses to the typed schema,<br/>ids exist, numbers in bounds?}
  P -- no --> DROP[Reply discarded and logged<br/>rules path continues]
  P -- yes --> NOM[AI text and nominated options<br/>labelled AI]
  DROP --> RU
  NOM --> POL[Policy engine re-derives eligibility<br/>from records, ignores AI claims]
  RU --> POL
  POL --> S{Save durable?}
  S -- confirmed --> OK[Shown as saved · logged]
  S -- failed --> ER[Shown as not saved · retry by same id]
  S -- unknown --> UN[Shown as pending · resolved on next launch]
